# Local-dev secret values for `wrangler pages dev`. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored
# — never commit a real key) and fill in a value; `wrangler pages dev`
# auto-loads `.dev.vars` from the repo root. scripts/audit/cli.ts (the
# Node-side audit runner) is a SEPARATE process and does NOT auto-load this
# file — export the same variable in your shell before running it, e.g.:
#
# export RANKING_IP_HASH_KEY=some-dev-only-value
# npx vite-node scripts/audit/cli.ts
#
# Any non-empty string works for local development — HMAC-SHA-256 (functions/
# _lib/ranking/ipHash.ts) treats the key as opaque bytes, there is no format
# requirement. In production this is a Cloudflare Pages secret (`wrangler
# pages secret put RANKING_IP_HASH_KEY`), set to a real random value and
# never checked into source control — see docs/ranking-audit-runbook.md.
RANKING_IP_HASH_KEY=local-dev-only-change-me
